da.DeltaLambdaFramework.graph","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptionE.DeltaLambda.DeltaLambdaFramework.graph","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OptionE/DeltaLambda.lean#L71-L71","doc":"The crystal graph at partition λ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptionE.DeltaLambda.DeltaLambdaFramework.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptionE.DeltaLambda.DeltaLambdaFramework.mk","kind":"ctor","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OptionE/DeltaLambda.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptionE.DeltaLambda.DeltaLambdaFramework","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptionE.DeltaLambda.DeltaLambdaFramework","kind":"structure","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OptionE/DeltaLambda.lean#L66-L77","doc":"**Δ_λ derivation framework**: a structure encoding the\ncrystal-graph + rung-selection + weight function that\nproduces a real-valued Δ_λ for a partition `λ ⊢ n`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}